    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n54364" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατ-ᾰλείφω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>besmear</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ κηρίον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					627a10
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πηλῷ φράγματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aen.Tact.
					37.9
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατήλειψε τὸν Χηραμὸν τῷ πηλῷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>NA</u>
					3.26
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i>apply an ointment</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Liqu.</u>
				6
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, dub. l. in <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				555a14
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταλήλειπταί τινι</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				551b5
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅταν καταλειφθῇ</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				554a30
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				9.112
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				1.657
			</span></i>. </div>
